WEBVTT

00:00:00.752 --> 00:00:05.572
In Settings, choose how the app looks: the same as your phone, light, or dark.

00:00:06.074 --> 00:00:12.924
Fill in your profile. The organisers see your capoeira name, or otherwise your name, in the list of who's going.

00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:30.265
Want the calendar without internet? Turn on Available offline and pick a level: Minimal, Maximum, or Maximum with all languages. The app then opens at once from your phone and updates in the background, while the light at the top turns orange. Turn it off and everything saved on your phone is removed.

00:00:30.766 --> 00:00:40.406
Put the app on your home screen. On iPhone, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen. On Android, use the menu. It then opens just like an app.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:45.677
Near the bottom you choose your language. You can also change it with the flag at the top.

00:00:46.177 --> 00:00:48.797
And the very last section lets you sign out.

